  "prefLabel": "En 402.15 Payphone service provider (PSP)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 402.15 “Payphone service provider (PSP)” means a person or entity that offers telephone service on a fee per call basis with payment due at the time of the call, and that has been issued a certificate of registration by the department to provide payphone service.\n\nSource. #14015, eff 7-1-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 400)",
